A cat.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "cat", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "cat-01FS2C5V2J05BWRQ4STSCXJWCR.jpeg", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35473885, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40855117, "text": "<h2>The Activity:</h2>\nAll the punctuation has fallen out of the piece of writing. Can you help stick it back together? \n<br></br>\nThe missing punctuation is in the box at the top of the page. Use your coloured pen or pencil to add it back into the writing. Cross off each piece of punctuation when you use it.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35473885, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40855802, "text": "Check Your Work", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 40855769, "text": "<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">M</span>any people keep cats as pets. But why could this be<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">?</span> Perhaps it<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">’</span>s because cats are furry<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">,</span> friendly and lots of fun. Cats love to play<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">.</span> <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">T</span>hey are also very intelligent and sociable, which makes them great pets. They are amazing at jumping and can run really fast<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">.</span> They can also squeeze through small spaces: unlike ours, cats<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">’</span> collarbones are not fixed to other bones, which means their shoulders can get narrower to fit through gaps<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">.</span> \n<br></br>\nIt is thought that the <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">R</span>omans probably first brought cats to <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">B</span>ritain to help control pests such as rats and mice. Nowadays, cats are still used for pest control, but they are also kept simply as pets. There are even some famous pet cats<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">!</span> Taylor <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">S</span>wift<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">’</span>s cat is called Meredith Grey and she is something of a social media star. \n<br></br>\nAnother famous cat is <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">L</span>arry, who lives in the Prime Minister<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">’</span>s house at 10 Downing Street. His official title is Chief Mouser to the Cabinet office. Larry hasn<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">’</span>t always got on with everyone, though he did enjoy a visit from Barrack Obama: Ex-Prime Minister <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">D</span>avid Cameron said, <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">“</span>Obama gave him a stroke and he was all right with Obama.<span style=\"color:#F28D00\">”</span>\n", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 59, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 59, "name": "Jumbled Punctuation Solution", "logCreatedAt": "2021-11-09T14:23:01.961086", "logUpdatedAt": "2022-01-10T16:10:51.267092", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35473885, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 59, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null